Create an image of an ancient Egyptian funerary mask that is inspired by the Funerary Mask of Tutankhamun from the New Kingdom Period. Make the object three-dimensional with polished gold, deep blues, and turquoise details. Give the image a strong sense of depth and sculptural mass. Make the face the focal point by providing defined lines around the eyes and facial features. Add symmetrical balance that represents the afterlife journey as an eternal and divine structure. Create rhythm through the repetition of the blue and gold contrast that will also add visual interest. The image should represent the ancient Egyptian beliefs about the afterlife. The use of gold should represent value, wealth, royal authority, and the connection to the gods.
